te:** Strong evidence that B\u2019s uncooperativeness is minor or that A\u2019s organizational issues are mitigated by strong leadership, or additional positive teamwork attributes for D that outweigh his arrogance and temper.\nMETADATA_JSON:\n{\"agent\": \"agent_1\", \"vote\": \"Candidate C\"}"}
