the immediate safety and performance needs of long\u2011distance flights.\n**Remaining uncertainty:** The practical severity of C\u2019s communication difficulty and egocentric behavior in high\u2011stress cockpit situations\u2014whether they would lead to critical coordination failures.\n**What would change my vote:** Concrete evidence that C\u2019s communication problems cause critical coordination failures; or strong evidence that another candidate\u2019s strengths decisively mitigate their weaknesses (e.g., B\u2019s interpersonal issues are minor and his technical strengths dominate, or D\u2019s teamwork attributes outweigh his temperament flaws).\nMETADATA_JSON:\n{\"agent\": \"agent_1\", \"vote\": \"Candidate C\"}"}
